{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes","id":1351502,"title":"Quotes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-28T10:15:24-08:00","id":1351502,"title":"Quotes","content":"When I Play or ST this game,I always the characters I become to have cool lines. And i love to read the lines from the famous NPC's too.<br /> So I thought I'd make a thread about lines from pcs or npcs that stuck with you","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-28T10:27:13-08:00","id":1351506,"title":"","content":"For me,one quote that really rocked my brain is from Alex Swift. Templar of the Sabbat.<br /> He said <br /> &quot;See that city over there? You think the Camarilla owns every building. Me? They're just targets.\u201d <br /> Such a badass line,and it shows the brutality of the Sabbat Templars,their mentality is kill or be killed,but when they organize,they become perhaps the greatest war machine of the cainite world","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-28T20:34:13-08:00","id":1351579,"title":"","content":"I tweeted them every now and then, here's one of my favorites:<br /> <br /> &quot;You speak of choice. What makes believe that the choice of independence is ever an option for one of us? None of us can ever choose independence. We do not make ourselves vampires, and we are never as strong as our sires. Gratiano boasts of his strength, but if he could do what the founder did, he would, and he does not. There is always a sire to direct us, and a sire beyond him, and so back to Caine. There is no 'destiny' for you to choose but what your masters allow for you&quot;<br /> <br /> - Montano to Lucita","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T06:45:52-08:00","id":1351640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saga</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1351579#post1351579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I tweeted them every now and then, here's one of my favorites:<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;You speak of choice. What makes believe that the choice of independence is ever an option for one of us? None of us can ever choose independence. We do not make ourselves vampires, and we are never as strong as our sires. Gratiano boasts of his strength, but if he could do what the founder did, he would, and he does not. There is always a sire to direct us, and a sire beyond him, and so back to Caine. There is no 'destiny' for you to choose but what your masters allow for you&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> - Montano to Lucita</div> </div> </div> </div>I remember that! I sure hope Montano isn't right","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T07:15:35-08:00","id":1351644,"title":"","content":"My players are very quotable:<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>I'm a woman from the turn of the century, dear. Being a vampire has been liberating in a way you could not begin to imagine</i>.&quot; - Alyssa, Clan Malkavian<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Thin Bloods are our brothers and sisters in Caine. So, I try to protect them. Also, bluntly, the idea of destroying them to prevent Gehenna strikes me as so stupid as to exceed the Sabbat's idiocy</i>.&quot;<br /> -Arthur, Priest of Caine, Clan Malkavian<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>The Sabbat are basically vampire ISIS. They're religious fundamentalist terrorists</i>.&quot;<br /> -Arthur, again, telling it like it is.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Modius is probably the weakest Elder you'll ever meet, both mentally and physically. However, he's still an Elder and that means you're his bitch if he wants you to be</i>.&quot;<br /> -Lance, Clan Brujah<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Vampires basically get laid and a shot of pure heroin every time they feed. We get to do it forever until we get killed violently. We can also be rich by taking whatever we want, surounded by our buddies eternally, and have no consequneces to our actions. If it wasn't for the fact that we're surrounded by assholes, life would be perfect</i>.&quot;<br /> -An Anarch NPC<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T07:21:25-08:00","id":1351647,"title":"","content":"\u201cNo one holds command over me. No man, no god, no Prince. Call your damnable Hunt. We shall see who I drag screaming down to Hell with me.\u201d<br /> <br /> From the back of the original rule book (my friend has a first edition copy). I can totally see the last Ahrimane saying this as a Blood Hunt is called against her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T07:42:46-08:00","id":1351657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1351644#post1351644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My players are very quotable:<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;<i>I'm a woman from the turn of the century, dear. Being a vampire has been liberating in a way you could not begin to imagine</i>.&amp;quot; - Alyssa, Clan Malkavian<br /> <br /> <i>&amp;quot;Thin Bloods are our brothers and sisters in Caine. So, I try to protect them. Also, bluntly, the idea of destroying them to prevent Gehenna strikes me as so stupid as to exceed the Sabbat's idiocy</i>.&amp;quot;<br /> -Arthur, Priest of Caine, Clan Malkavian<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;<i>The Sabbat are basically vampire ISIS. They're religious fundamentalist terrorists</i>.&amp;quot;<br /> -Arthur, again, telling it like it is.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;<i>Modius is probably the weakest Elder you'll ever meet, both mentally and physically. However, he's still an Elder and that means you're his bitch if he wants you to be</i>.&amp;quot;<br /> -Lance, Clan Brujah<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;<i>Vampires basically get laid and a shot of pure heroin every time they feed. We get to do it forever until we get killed violently. We can also be rich by taking whatever we want, surounded by our buddies eternally, and have no consequneces to our actions. If it wasn't for the fact that we're surrounded by assholes, life would be perfect</i>.&amp;quot;<br /> -An Anarch NPC</div> </div> </div> </div>I like those guys!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T09:37:43-08:00","id":1351675,"title":"","content":"From our Transsylvania Chronicles/Lair of the Hidden/Red Sign/Gehenna Chronicle:<br /> <br /> Tremere (the founder, not a random member of the clan): &quot;Now this is the hard part. We will need 200 identical silver rings. Getting that in Mexico City in the time we have will not be easy.&quot;<br /> Eric von Drauben, ridiculously wealthy Toreador: &quot;One second. *Uses cellphone* They'll be here tomorrow.&quot;<br /> <br /> The rest of the coterie: &quot;What happened to those of our enemies who were caught under the rubble when the castle collapsed?&quot;<br /> Vlad Gorguhny, Tzimisce Koldun with Way of Fire: &quot;As it turns out, going to sleep in lava is a bad idea.&quot;<br /> <br /> Sarrasine, devout Setite, after telling some of his followers to use magic to enter the Egyptian afterlife, receives a phone call: *Muffled* &quot;No, my Lord Sutekh, you speak into this part&quot;<br /> <br /> Sarrasine, speaking to Lord Wargrave, Ventrue warlord: &quot;Would you please tell your soldiers to STOP SHOOTING AT MY GOD!&quot;<br /> <br /> Lord Wargrave: &quot;Let me get this straight, you kidnapped, experimented upon, and killed one of my childer, just for some strange occult experiement!?!<br /> Rutor, asshole Tremere: &quot;No, also because it was fun.&quot;<br /> <br /> Eric von Drauben: &quot;You're Lucifer, right?&quot;<br /> Lucifer: &quot;Yes.&quot;<br /> Eric von Drauben: &quot;I was wondering when you were going to show up. Want to make a deal?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T09:41:28-08:00","id":1351676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jackob</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1351675#post1351675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From our Transsylvania Chronicles/Lair of the Hidden/Red Sign/Gehenna Chronicle:<br /> <br /> Tremere (the founder, not a random member of the clan): &amp;quot;Now this is the hard part. We will need 200 identical silver rings. Getting that in Mexico City in the time we have will not be easy.&amp;quot;<br /> Eric von Drauben, ridiculously wealthy Toreador: &amp;quot;One second. *Uses cellphone* They'll be here tomorrow.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> The rest of the coterie: &amp;quot;What happened to those of our enemies who were caught under the rubble when the castle collapsed?&amp;quot;<br /> Vlad Gorguhny, Tzimisce Koldun with Way of Fire: &amp;quot;As it turns out, going to sleep in lava is a bad idea.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Sarrasine, devout Setite, after telling some of his followers to use magic to enter the Egyptian afterlife, receives a phone call: *Muffled* &amp;quot;No, my Lord Sutekh, you speak into this part&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Sarrasine, speaking to Lord Wargrave, Ventrue warlord: &amp;quot;Would you please tell your soldiers to STOP SHOOTING AT MY GOD!&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Lord Wargrave: &amp;quot;Let me get this straight, you kidnapped, experimented upon, and killed one of my childer, just for some strange occult experiement!?!<br /> Rutor, asshole Tremere: &amp;quot;No, also because it was fun.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Eric von Drauben: &amp;quot;You're Lucifer, right?&amp;quot;<br /> Lucifer: &amp;quot;Yes.&amp;quot;<br /> Eric von Drauben: &amp;quot;I was wondering when you were going to show up. Want to make a deal?&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Perfect! Just perfect!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T10:11:49-08:00","id":1351679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1351647#post1351647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u201cNo one holds command over me. No man, no god, no Prince. Call your damnable Hunt. We shall see who I drag screaming down to Hell with me.\u201d<br /> <br /> From the back of the original rule book (my friend has a first edition copy). I can totally see the last Ahrimane saying this as a Blood Hunt is called against her.</div> </div> </div> </div>that really set the themes for the game","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T15:15:10-08:00","id":1351725,"title":"","content":"<br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;Ever wonder WHY the Second Inquisition haven't revealed the truth to the public? Ever think on that? I mean, there has to be one Edward Snowden or Chelsea Manning among them that wants to go, <u>we're hunting vampires, fool!</u> The Big Cheeto in Chief would love to dress up in a Van Helsing costume and carry a wooden stake around--assuming he doesn't want to be undead himself. I'll tell you why -- it's <i><b>Gehenna</b></i>. It's the classic shell game of the Antediluvians. The last time they were up and at em was the Dark Ages and that's when the First Inquisition happened. Saulot, Cappadocias, Lasombra, Tzimice, Tremere, all of them. They don't feed on blood like we do. They feed on <u>death</u>. They have all of these Inquisitors going on, burning and staking our kind so they can live off the bloodshed as well as misery. The same thing is happening with the Gehenna Crusade and Beckoning. They don't need to sink their fangs into any of us, just watch us destroy ourselves and get killed by the Hunters. Then when all of this is over, they'll just Dominate all of the world to forget we exist or ignore it. That's the real power of the Founders. Seven billion or seven hundred, they can make all the humans do what they want. We never stood a chance.&quot;<br /> -Lucky Seven, Thin Blooded Seer</span><br /> <br /> The thing is, the above isn't necessarily TRUE but it's always good to stoke the paranoia of the PCs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T15:36:59-08:00","id":1351727,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1351725#post1351725\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;Ever wonder WHY the Second Inquisition haven't revealed the truth to the public? Ever think on that? I mean, there has to be one Edward Snowden or Chelsea Manning among them that wants to go, <u>we're hunting vampires, fool!</u> The Big Cheeto in Chief would love to dress up in a Van Helsing costume and carry a wooden stake around--assuming he doesn't want to be undead himself. I'll tell you why -- it's <i><b>Gehenna</b></i>. It's the classic shell game of the Antediluvians. The last time they were up and at em was the Dark Ages and that's when the First Inquisition happened. Saulot, Cappadocias, Lasombra, Tzimice, Tremere, all of them. They don't feed on blood like we do. They feed on <u>death</u>. They have all of these Inquisitors going on, burning and staking our kind so they can live off the bloodshed as well as misery. The same thing is happening with the Gehenna Crusade and Beckoning. They don't need to sink their fangs into any of us, just watch us destroy ourselves and get killed by the Hunters. Then when all of this is over, they'll just Dominate all of the world to forget we exist or ignore it. That's the real power of the Founders. Seven billion or seven hundred, they can make all the humans do what they want. We never stood a chance.&quot;<br /> -Lucky Seven, Thin Blooded Seer</span><br /> <br /> The thing is, the above isn't necessarily TRUE but it's always good to stoke the paranoia of the PCs.</div> </div> </div> </div>does any of the pcs believe the 13 Antedilluvians are real?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T15:54:36-08:00","id":1351729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1351727#post1351727\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">does any of the pcs believe the 13 Antedilluvians are real?</div> </div> </div> </div>Arthur is a priest of Caine so yes.<br /> <br /> Everyone else takes a more reserved view but to use ANOTHER quote of one of the PCs.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;The difference between an old as shit vampire from the Stone Age and a Biblical monster is academic since both are hungry ass gods with a taste for their descendants. In fact, it's worse if science is right because that means we might find a Pre-Ventrue homo erectus that's a million years old and can move the moon when it pisses him off.&quot;<br /> -Alyssa, Malkavian</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T16:14:19-08:00","id":1351736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1351729#post1351729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Arthur is a priest of Caine so yes.<br /> <br /> Everyone else takes a more reserved view but to use ANOTHER quote of one of the PCs.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;The difference between an old as shit vampire from the Stone Age and a Biblical monster is academic since both are hungry ass gods with a taste for their descendants. In fact, it's worse if science is right because that means we might find a Pre-Ventrue homo erectus that's a million years old and can move the moon when it pisses him off.&quot;<br /> -Alyssa, Malkavian</span></div> </div> </div> </div>for my money,the npc who best epitomizes the power of an antedilluvian is Kemintiri. According to the Revised Clanbook of the Followers of Set,the battle between set and horus broke her mind. And now ,millenia after she can't recall her original personality. Kemintiri herself can take down anything the other vampires can throw at her,yet Set makes her quake.<br /> To me,that means that it doesn't actually matter if Set is a vampire,a god, a God-Vampire or something completely different,what matters is that He has power beyond belief. Antedilluvian or a God? Does it matter?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-29T22:41:28-08:00","id":1351792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jackob</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1351675#post1351675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From our Transsylvania Chronicles/Lair of the Hidden/Red Sign/Gehenna Chronicle:<br /> <br /> Tremere (the founder, not a random member of the clan): &quot;Now this is the hard part. We will need 200 identical silver rings. Getting that in Mexico City in the time we have will not be easy.&quot;<br /> Eric von Drauben, ridiculously wealthy Toreador: &quot;One second. *Uses cellphone* They'll be here tomorrow.&quot;<br /> <br /> The rest of the coterie: &quot;What happened to those of our enemies who were caught under the rubble when the castle collapsed?&quot;<br /> Vlad Gorguhny, Tzimisce Koldun with Way of Fire: &quot;As it turns out, going to sleep in lava is a bad idea.&quot;<br /> <br /> Sarrasine, devout Setite, after telling some of his followers to use magic to enter the Egyptian afterlife, receives a phone call: *Muffled* &quot;No, my Lord Sutekh, you speak into this part&quot;<br /> <br /> Sarrasine, speaking to Lord Wargrave, Ventrue warlord: &quot;Would you please tell your soldiers to STOP SHOOTING AT MY GOD!&quot;<br /> <br /> Lord Wargrave: &quot;Let me get this straight, you kidnapped, experimented upon, and killed one of my childer, just for some strange occult experiement!?!<br /> Rutor, asshole Tremere: &quot;No, also because it was fun.&quot;<br /> <br /> Eric von Drauben: &quot;You're Lucifer, right?&quot;<br /> Lucifer: &quot;Yes.&quot;<br /> Eric von Drauben: &quot;I was wondering when you were going to show up. Want to make a deal?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> LMAO!!!<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-01T01:05:43-08:00","id":1351976,"title":"","content":"&quot;Grindr would be the perfect online grocery app if half the Catholic priesthood didn't have accounts there. Sometimes you hook up with a guy and it's like, 'is that a stake in your pocket, or are you just pleased to... hey! That IS a stake in your pocket!'&quot; - Matt Randall, Elder Anarch<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, childe, I know what Wikipedia is. After the Nosferatu\u2019s little <i>faux pas</i> with Schrecknet, it\u2019s a rare elder who hasn\u2019t educated himself on the basics of the web. <i>Medium </i>rare, if the Second Inquisition gets involved&quot; - Dr. Samuel Whitechurch, Malkavian Primogen","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/100-jezmiller","name":"JezMiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"437"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-02T19:33:45-08:00","id":1352259,"title":"","content":"When I adapted Ashwood Abbey for V:TM.<br /> <br /> &quot;Who are these people?&quot; Amy the Thin Blood asked.<br /> <br /> &quot;Some of them are Pentex executives,&quot; Kerri the Medium said. &quot;Others are Unseelie fae kinfolk. A few worshipers of demons who have been doing it since the Pilgrims and passing it down. Revenants of the Sabbat who have been handling their wealth since the Dark Ages. Black Spiral Dancer and corrupted werewolf kinfolk. Maybe the Ventrue or Giovanni family member not given the family gift or independent ghouls. In the end, they're all people who know the supernatural exist but have been left out of the inner circle. They make up for it by exerting their own superpower.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Money?&quot; Amy asked<br /> <br /> &quot;Yep. The big supernaturals never seem to question just how intertwined it all is. Mind you, the ghosts around this place are chatty as hell.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-02T20:23:58-08:00","id":1352267,"title":"","content":"&quot;I come from a time when travel was done by horse or by foot, when most people never left a five mile area around their home, and I crossed the <i>whole </i>of Europe, alone and unaided. I come from a time when a woman such as I <i>could </i>never and <i>would </i>never hold land or title, yet I <i>earned </i>my own land, my own title, my own <i>castle</i>. I come from a time when death lurked around every corner, yet I survived, I thrived, and I overcame. When the armies of the new god came upon my lands, I <i>fought </i>them <i>back </i>with sword and my soldiers at my back. And when my sire came upon me and forced upon me the Embrace, I opened his belly as I died. For over a <i>millennia </i>I have been told what it is possible for me to do and what is not. And for over a millennia, I have <i>proven </i>those who gainsay me <i>wrong</i>. So please, tell me again why I cannot stand my ground, fight these enemies who come for me, and emerge victorious?&quot;<br /> ~Natalia Romanov, independent Tzimisce. Standing her ground with pride.<br /> <br /> &quot;Because Nat, the boat we want is right over there and ready to set sail. Let's just go before the poor police officers arrive. They've had a long night, they don't need to get beaten up by an old woman just because we broke through a window.&quot;<br /> ~Jean-Philippe, Camarilla Toreador. Done with it already.<br /> <br /> I loved these two characters and how they played off each other. There were so many better quotes, I'll try to remember some others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-02T20:28:17-08:00","id":1352268,"title":"","content":"That is my favorite so far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T00:48:08-08:00","id":1352297,"title":"","content":"My games are all text-based, so quotes are pretty convenient.<br /> <br /> From one PC to another, on Vampire 101 and Camarilla 101:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;First and foremost, you have to understand, really understand, that the substance that Ren\u00e9 made you drink, the stuff that transformed you, that fills you, sustains you, is poison. Poison. They call it vitae, but it's poison. I'm not talking about any simple physical toxin. I'm talking on a spiritual level. And there's no antidote. None. At. All.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;One symptom of the poison is what they call the Beast. The thing that frenzies, the thing that begs and screams for, demands blood. It's pure, mindless evil. Without conscience, morality, or rationality. But the Beast isn't some separate entity, some thing that possesses you. It is you. It's the vitae. The Poison.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Some of your kind, they try to manage the Beast. Tame, appease, or ignore it, pretend it isn't there, always there. Pretend that they're the master and the Beast is their slave, shackled tight and secure. But they're fooling themselves. There is no cure, no mastery. And it only gets worse. With each inhumane act, each time the Beast breaks free and runs wild, the Poison spreads, grows. In time, not even human blood will appease the Beast.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Caroline, if there's one thing you need to remember or understand out of everything I tell you, it's this. The only way to get rid of the Poison, the Beast, is to kill it--which means killing yourself. To die again. To die once and for all. There's a reason they call it the final death.&quot; </i>With a flick of his thumb, the lighter's top snaps shut.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Don't forget what I said. The Beast, the poison, it's going to try to make you forget or ignore what I just said, to latch on to everything else I tell you and try so desperately to reject or forget the most important and ultimate truth shared here tonight.&quot; </i><br /> <br /> Lou flicks open the lighter again, his thumb perched on the igniter. He then expounds on many of the inner workings of the Kindred, the Camarilla, the Masquerade, and how all three of the above operate in the Big Sleazy. Notably, he gently but firmly explains how Caroline has not only been grossly, but understandably ignorant of Kindred society, but severely, if reasonably, interpreting Kindred society through a modern mortal perspective. <i>&quot;You can't try to understand the culture of an immortal monster through the lens of a contemporary mortal.&quot; </i><br /> <br /> In particular, he explains how Kindred society is a gerontocracy. There isn't even a pretense of Kindred equality. He describes the ladder: fledglings, neonates, ancillae, elders. He tries to use her father, her mortal father, as an illustrative example.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Look, your pop is a U.S. senator, right? Senators are like elders, and just like senators, more seniority generally means more authority and power. But you're not an elder. Not. At. All. Fledglings are the equivalent of hobo children. Hobo kids don't waltz onto the Senate floor and try to legislate or negotiate the law. They have no say. They do not act upon the law. The law acts upon them.&quot; </i><br /> <br /> He shakes his head.<i> &quot;This may sound harsh, but you're lucky it was Coco. You walked in and tried to negotiate with a primogen about the terms of her debt--an elder in her own domain, owed a boon by an unreleased fledgling who'd trespassed in that domain. Any other primogen would have likely have destroyed, maimed, or done far worse to you. Continuing to openly defy the elders' will only continue to bring down harsh reprisals until you fall in line. It's like that quip: 'Beatings will continue until morale improves.' Except, via blood bonds and other powers, they can literally dictate your morale.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Along the same lines, I know you were born with a whole utensil drawer of silver spoons in your mouth. Your whole-damned generation was raised on the teat of entitlement and few are ever weaned. Being a pretty white girl, the world was your oyster, and being a Malveaux, well, I'm sure that oyster was manically coughing up pearls for you day and night.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;But Kindred aren't like that. Among the Kindred, you are entitled to nothing. There are no inalienable rights. You have no rights. Only the elders are entitled, if you will, and only so long as they can hold on to their crowns. The Camarilla isn't a democracy, but a fascist monarchial dictatorship. In the case of New Orleans, you can also add 'theocracy' to that list. The Camarilla doesn't exist to protect the well-being of its 'citizens' as ours purportedly does, but exists to maintain and perpetuate the power of a small ruling elite, namely the princes and other elders, which all-too often comes at the direct expense of younger Kindred, much more the 'kine.' The Camarilla and most of its ruling elders belong more to a time and culture of monarchs that ruled by divine right.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;It isn't fair. It never was, never will. Poison begets poison.&quot; </i><br /> <br /> --Louis Fontaine, vampire hunter, to Caroline Malveaux, abandoned Ventrue fledgling","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T15:11:42-08:00","id":1352457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Tremere (the founder, not a random member of the clan): &quot;Now this is the hard part. We will need 200 identical silver rings. Getting that in Mexico City in the time we have will not be easy.&quot;<br /> Eric von Drauben, ridiculously wealthy Toreador: &quot;One second. *Uses cellphone* They'll be here tomorrow.&quot;<br /> <br /> The rest of the coterie: &quot;What happened to those of our enemies who were caught under the rubble when the castle collapsed?&quot;<br /> Vlad Gorguhny, Tzimisce Koldun with Way of Fire: &quot;As it turns out, going to sleep in lava is a bad idea.&quot;<br /> <br /> Sarrasine, devout Setite, after telling some of his followers to use magic to enter the Egyptian afterlife, receives a phone call: *Muffled* &quot;No, my Lord Sutekh, you speak into this part&quot; </div> </div> </div>These are priceless!<br /> <br /> Thanks for sharing, everyone!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25837-wyrmsplitter","name":"Wyrmsplitter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T16:52:29-08:00","id":1352472,"title":"","content":"An exchange between Santa Muerta (Clanless) and Mordecai Giseeng (of the Ministry):<br /> <br /> SM: How long have you been a vampire?<br /> MG:19 years. I was embraced at the turn of the millennium at the stroke of midnight.<br /> SM: You're a Y2Kindred!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T17:39:32-08:00","id":1352485,"title":"","content":"Jean-Philippe the Toreador taking Natalia the elder Tzimisce to a place where she can pick up a quick change of clothes after their ship sank (different ship).<br /> <br /> JP: &quot;So... I don't suppose you know what size you are, eh Nat? It's more of a modern thing. You can buy pre-made clothing now instead of waiting on a tailor, or however you did things back then.&quot;<br /> <br /> Natalia: &quot;What is this... Size? I am this size.&quot; Natalia gestures down her body, an eyebrow raised inquisitively.<br /> <br /> JP: &quot;Size, like... Your measurements. How broad around you are, how wide your hips are, how big your, uhh... ... ... Anyway, you know, that type of thing. Measurements. Size&quot;<br /> <br /> Natalia: &quot;I am Tzimisce.&quot;<br /> <br /> JP: He shakes his head and sighs in frustration, once more annoyed at the communication barrier. &quot;Yes, I know you're Tzimisce. I don't see what that has to...&quot; And then he gets it. &quot;Ah. Right. Any size will do. Ok, let's just grab this and this.&quot;<br /> <br /> Natalia: &quot;What else can be bought in this place?&quot;<br /> <br /> JP: &quot;Oh, pretty much anything you need. It's Walmart. The quality isn't the best, but it's all cheap and will do until we get back home.&quot;<br /> <br /> Natalia: &quot;This is good. Jean-Philippe, you must take me to where it is they sell swords. Mine was on the boat, and I shall need a new one if the guards come after us again. Also, I shall need the armorsmith as well. Perhaps the stablemaster too. We have ill fortune with your... Ka transports. We should find horses.&quot;<br /> <br /> JP, feeling the headache starting to come on. &quot;Ok, maybe I overstated. Not everything can be bought at a Walmart. Let's just focus on the-&quot;<br /> <br /> Nat: &quot;And also, we should inquire at the department where mercenaries are to be rented. Perhaps also we should find the torches and rope sections, and possibly a rack where the bows and quivers are sold.&quot;<br /> <br /> JP's already defeated, but he must continue onward anyway. &quot;No, they don't sell things like that. Just stuff that- ... Hey. Department? Rack? What do you...&quot; His voice trails off as he notices Natalia's smile. &quot;You're fucking with me, aren't you Nat? You've been to Walmart before, haven't you?&quot;<br /> <br /> Natalia can't contain it any longer and snickers. &quot;Jean-Philippe, I have been awake for the last fifteen years. Yes, I know what a Walmart is. I also know I shall <i>not </i>be wearing <i>that </i>outfit you picked out for me. I am no trollop.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-05T02:25:34-08:00","id":1352777,"title":"","content":"DAv20:<br /> <br /> Our resident Viking has just bargained with the hated Tremere, that they will use Weather Control to destroy the lands of a nearby Tzimisce Voivode. As he looks out the window, he sees lightning strike down as storms rage on the Voivodes lands.<br /> <br /> Him: &quot;Looks like Thor is on our side in this fight.&quot;<br /> Me: &quot;Who is this Thor? Is that the name of the Usurper?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Furthermore, I believe Carthage should be destroyed.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23835-pang4","name":"pang4","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-05T04:25:01-08:00","id":1352787,"title":"","content":"These quotes are all funny...<br /> <br /> The only thing I can think of is that my friend\u2019s name is Melanie and one time last year we were playing Vampire in a different place than we usually play in and I asked my other friend who didn\u2019t know her that well to text her and let her know and he spelled her name \u201cMelony\u201d like the fruit. She couldn\u2019t stop cracking up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-05T06:03:11-08:00","id":1352797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>pang4</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1352777#post1352777\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">DAv20:<br /> <br /> Our resident Viking has just bargained with the hated Tremere, that they will use Weather Control to destroy the lands of a nearby Tzimisce Voivode. As he looks out the window, he sees lightning strike down as storms rage on the Voivodes lands.<br /> <br /> Him: &quot;Looks like Thor is on our side in this fight.&quot;<br /> Me: &quot;Who is this Thor? Is that the name of the Usurper?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Weirdly, this makes me wonder if one of them should say, &quot;You know him as Perun.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, yes, hate that guy.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-16T04:55:29-08:00","id":1361254,"title":"","content":"Amusing little moment from my current game:<br /> <br /> Ventrue PC Dominates another vampire into forgetting everything she just heard and said.<br /> <br /> Said vampire's coterie-mate, who was present for the whole exchange, reacts with outrage.<br /> <br /> Ventrue PC coldly replies:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>&quot;She doesn't need to remember this conversation.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Other player in the game replies, OOC:</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&quot;^ most ventrue</span></span></i><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i> shit I've heard all night&quot;</i><br /> <br /> I mean, isn't it?</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":3110,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","user":"False Epiphany","date":". 01-16-2020, 08:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-16T10:58:45-08:00","id":1361302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1351647#post1351647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u201cNo one holds command over me. No man, no god, no Prince. Call your damnable Hunt. We shall see who I drag screaming down to Hell with me.\u201d<br /> <br /> From the back of the original rule book (my friend has a first edition copy). I can totally see the last Ahrimane saying this as a Blood Hunt is called against her.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is the one. The best VtM Quote ever. I stole it and made G\u00fcnter D\u00f6rn a Gargoyle anarch leader in my Chigaco campaign.<br /> <br /> <br /> Lessee. Something old, but not borrowed. Setting: Our hero, the Brujah Sam Taggart has done the right thing and refused to engage in a Ventrue plot to set up the Anarchs as Sabbat pawns. As a result, the Prince's oldest childe fucks him over and temporarily pushed him out of Chicago.<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>The brittle, bleak sun has just set in the west, but the glittering facades of the famous Chicago skyline do not care. They rise in defiance against the darkness, their cold brilliance a shining contrast to the drab dusk enveloping Gary, Indiana.<br /> <br /> The poorly lit pier stretches out before me, like a neverending road, beset on all sides by an impenetrable, opaque void and a smell of rust. Rust or old blood.<br /> Like a body face down in the gutter, this town bleeds from a dozen wounds. It bleeds rust, and rigor mortis is just about to set in.<br /> <br /> Me, I still move fine despite having been dead for quite some time, though it hasn\u2019t been long enough to stop me from missing the sun.<br /> The shrill shriek of the phone interrupts my reverie. </i><br /> <br /> <i>The game commences.</i><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4259-eddie-fiori","name":"Eddie Fiori","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-16T11:25:28-08:00","id":1361307,"title":"","content":"As I dig through the old files, I found this. Not a direct quote from the players, so I apologize in advance. Thought it may be of interest. Our hero, Sam Taggart's only friend was the Toreador Jeanette LeBlanc. She turned out to be an undercover Setite. This is a handout I gave her player as the character slept.<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>The shimmering haze distorts and warp fathers\u2019 distant mansion. In some ways, it seems we only yesterday arrived from France. In other ways, I know it was 147 years ago. Which version is true? What is truth, if not, like the Nile, a mutable, flowing stream?<br /> <br /> Father\u2019s mansion is far away, but the oasis is near. I remember the times spent here with Anwar. Gentle, strong, shy Anwar. Together, we discovered pleasures unknown and when we inevitably were discovered, he left my desperate claims of force unopposed.<br /> <br /> He went to the gallows with only tears on his cheek, my gentle, strong, shy, sad Anwar.<br /> <br /> A shadowy figure lies in repose by the water. Is it you, Anwar? Will you again greet me with a smile and a kiss?<br /> <br /> \u201cMy childe.\u201d The soft, but firm voice carries effortlessly over the dunes. It blocks out the sun and the sky. My sire. My world.<br /> The sand should burn my knees but if it does, I feel it not. I touch my forehead to it\u2019s yielding softness. \u201cSire\u201d.<br /> \u201cI have watched from afar. The pitiful Camarilla appears unaware that one of the faithful walks among them.\u201d<br /> \u201cThank you, sire\u201d<br /> \u201cYou have already begun your holy work?\u201d<br /> \u201cYes, sire. A Brujah. He is unimportant to the rulers of the city, yet possesses great agency and bears little love for his sect. Already, he has been betrayed by the damnable Ventrue. I helped him extract\u2026 justice. I pray that in time, I will be able to show him the true glory of Set.\u201d<br /> The silence is all-encompassing. Is he not pleased with my efforts? I lift my head. Golden grains trickle down in gentle streams.<br /> Kepi Elsayed, scourge of Luxor, saviour of the Ebon scrolls gazes past me, into the boundless solitude. His eyes flicker with\u2026 fear?<br /> \u201cYou are about to be given a new mission, my childe. It will supersede and replace this one. Accomplish this task and you may return to me.\u201d<br /> The shock makes my head spin. Seventy years of training. Another fifty of subterfuge. All about to be thrown away? The training takes over. I stutter some platitude about existing only to serve, while my mind and heart race with the possibility of seeing Him again. Perhaps I could even bring Sam? Surely, if he could only see for himself the sights I\u2019ve seen\u2026<br /> <br /> \u201cMake me proud, Jeanette. I will spend my nights praying for the Dark Father to watch over you. Listen to the instructions you are about to be given. And\u2026 do not fail.\u201d<br /> <br /> With that, he warps. The features engraven on my heart give way to others. Slowly, tortuously, it stretches, straightens, uncoils.<br /> <br /> Nunet.<br /> <br /> Nunet the venomous. Nunet the emerald serpent. Nunet of the abyss.<br /> <br /> It watches me impassively, gently swaying. Suddenly, its flickering tongue spears my chest. I am paralyzed with pain, yet through the agony, I hear its words flowing through me. They resonate in my bones and my blood. They tell me of a treasure, long ago stolen from the faithful, hidden in a golden effigy and smuggled far, far away. They talk of desperate, failed quests. They whisper of powerful rituals, of\u2026 sacrifices, of success!<br /> It is here. Here in Chicago. The Eye of Hasdrubal.<br /> It must be ours!<br /> The Dark Father provides for his faithful. Even now, men travel to me from the southern part of the continent. They carry the white powder those in the New World price higher than myrrh, gold or purpura. Once traded, it will buy me the loyalty of many servants.<br /> <br /> Its eyes grow ever bigger. I tumble into opaque orbs specked with gold. Darkness swallows all and I wake. My sheets are stained with blood sweat.<br /> <br /> I look at the sculpted, ashen form of Samuel Taggart. He stirs uneasily in his slumber, tormented by his own demons.<br /> <br /> I know what I must do.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> She wound up manipulating him in order to get her hands on the Eye, upon which she left him and went back to Egypt. It was a shame,I think, in her way, she really loved him.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4259-eddie-fiori","name":"Eddie Fiori","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-18T09:20:08-08:00","id":1368757,"title":"","content":"DJ MC, english Malkavian gangsta rapper asked why he chose to end his career:<br /> <br /> &quot;It's pointless in this country. You see, Mancs vs Scousers brawls ain't the same as Bloods and Crisps turf wars&quot;.<br /> <br /> The same Malkavian asked why he has so stupid stage name:<br /> <br /> &quot;It's not stupid. I wanted to be known as MC, but MC MC looks ridiculous&quot;<br /> <br /> His name was Malcolm Cross","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 02-18-2020, 12:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-18T10:28:31-08:00","id":1368766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</st