sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-18T11:24:43-08:00","id":1368776,"title":"","content":"&quot;Do you smoke?&quot;<br /> &quot;Only if torch-wielding peasants with pitchforks get involved&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The entire Camarilla are on red alert. Except the Toreador, who are on vermilion alert with a subtle hint of lavender&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Her ladyship has excellent taste&quot;<br /> &quot;I know, I've tried her&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;To save everyone a question, yes, I\u2019m covered from head to toe in pigeon shit and powdered concrete. And I\u2019ll be on display at the Tate Modern from next Monday&quot;<br /> <br /> \u201cThe Kindred responsible for covering up this kind of incident had a few things to say to me earlier this evening. He rather forcefully made the point that we <i><b>cannot </b></i>simply keep blaming Fathers 4 Justice when something like this happens. Even after the Batman incident at the Palace, there\u2019s a limit to what people will believe they\u2019re capable of doing\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/100-jezmiller","name":"JezMiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"437"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-18T11:35:59-08:00","id":1368779,"title":"","content":"3 Cainites and a Risen speeding through the city in a car (about 220 km/h). Risen: &quot;Slow down or you'll kill us all&quot;<br /> <br /> And from one of my girlfriend's games:<br /> <br /> Two characters discussing a problem: one of them fell in love with a Lupine (a fine young lad he was). The older one describes what Lupines are capable of. Suddenly the other one, with an excitement in her eye and devilish grin on her lips:<br /> <br /> &quot;WAIT WAIT WAIT, he's getting bigger EVERYWHERE?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 03-01-2020, 09:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-20T18:25:59-08:00","id":1369260,"title":"","content":"Arthur said, &quot;Antediluvians, really? Oh that's just rumor too. People just say, oh a lion exists because it reminds you of a housecat but bigger. Just like this Aslan must be a large housecat who reminds you of a king. So must the Antediluvians just be an ordinary elder blown out of proportion. The Antediluvians just being a psychological scare tactic of people's primordial Freudian fear of their sires.&quot;<br /> <br /> Alex said, &quot;I think this is the first time that I have ever heard the works of CS lewis quoted by a vampire along with Freud.&quot;<br /> <br /> Kerri said, &quot;I dunno, I think Malkavians would do it all the time.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulh