 Then... oh then you make an enemy of the prince all to try and lure out father hoping he'll appear to slap you on the wrist... And after all that you come to me expecting a warm welcome and a slap on the back?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;... So you won't hide me from the bloodhunt,&quot;<br /> <br /> Me with my sheriff's badge &quot;b**** I am the bloodhunt&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25838,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25838-dart93","user":"Dart93","date":".  Sorry, language 02-21-2020, 05:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25838-dart93","name":"Dart93","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-21T07:59:37-08:00","id":1369372,"title":"","content":"Something I've seen on a clan inspired t-shirt:<br /> <br /> Malkavian: &quot;You say that I should listen the voices in my head? Are you nuts? They are crazy&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-28T18:13:14-08:00","id":1371128,"title":"","content":"This came from a game I was in (it was set in first edition)...<br /> <br /> Balthazar (to Damien): Of course I'm not obsessed with you; you're just too ugly for me.<br /> <br /> Damien: No, you prefer them when they're 7-years-old and call you &quot;daddy&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-29T07:40:15-08:00","id":1371973,"title":"","content":"These are from Mage but still I think they're worth mentioning<br /> <br /> 1. Virtual Adept and Cultist of Ecstasy are bragging about how they will deal with the MiBs. An Order of Hermes mage stands near them obviously furious about their lack of discipline. Finally he strikes a pose which suggests that he will throw a fireball or lightning bolt on them and says: <br /> &quot;Shut up. Just put a cork in it&quot;<br /> And that's how a hermetic cork was created (later it became a minor rote.)<br /> <br /> Damn, in Polish it sounded better<br /> <br /> 2. The same VA about a Cultist barrabi they were after:<br /> &quot;And then this Cthulthist...&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 02-29-2020, 07:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]