t not all evil that mankind has faced is vampires manipulation:<br /> <br /> &quot;Remember, Hitler and Stalin were mortals&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-04T09:03:56-08:00","id":1372723,"title":"","content":"From my last game to the thinblood I've been protecting after he mauled three thugs to death. <br /> &quot;Boy you may not be my childe but you sure as s*** are my fledgling&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25838-dart93","name":"Dart93","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-04T09:09:50-08:00","id":1372724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dart93</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1372723#post1372723\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From my last game to the thinblood I've been protecting after he mauled three thugs to death. <br /> &amp;quot;Boy you may not be my childe but you sure as s*** are my fledgling&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I love it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-29T13:43:12-07:00","id":1377224,"title":"","content":"It's not a quote per se, but I find it interesting and I think its place is here: one of Polish brewerage producers hides short phrases under bottle caps (&quot;Behave yourself&quot;, &quot;Your turn&quot;, &quot;I'm crazy about you&quot; and many more). As me and my gf sometimes give the caps with romantic/funny quotes to each other I got an idea for a Malkavian who uses caps like those in normal conversation. Those conversations last a little longer (try to find a correct phrase among under least a few hundreds bottle caps) and this gives this Malkavian one advantage and three disadvantages. The good thing is that he has +2 maybe even +3 modifier (I still use old editions rolls) to all Subterfuge rolls against him. The bad news: he automaticaly fails all Subterfuge rolls and Stealth rolls (he jingle all the way \ud83d\ude1c). And he won't use phone or radio.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-04T11:15:20-07:00","id":1485788,"title":"","content":"\u201cMoney and success don\u2019t change people; they merely amplify what is already there.\u201d<br /> (Will Smith)<br /> Also, You can read famous quotes at <a href=\"https://quotessearchengine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">quotessearchengine</a> and this is one of the best place to read quotes online.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27476,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27476-colin86","user":"colin86","date":". 07-05-2022, 02:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27476-colin86","name":"colin86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-04T13:16:18-07:00","id":1485795,"title":"","content":"&quot;The wisest among the Damned have learned to ask questions only when they want the answers.<br /> <br /> Even so, it is always disconcerting to be confronted with the fact that some questions have no answers.<br /> <br /> The night has a will of its own, and as much as the Kindred might posture to the contrary, we belong to it, and not the other way around.&quot;<br /> <br /> -Luther Franke, Die Neuen G\u00f6tter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3201,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","user":"Father Enoch","date":". 07-04-2022, 04:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-04T22:11:57-07:00","id":1485817,"title":"","content":"Well, I should note the best quotes of my game now. Even though some meanings might just disappear from the Portuguese translation.<br /> But I've got some nice quotes from the Dark Ages Clan Novels, which are great! Here is one from J\u00fcrgen:<br /> <br /> &quot;A mortal who witnesses a possible miracle can more easily rededicate his brief life to God\u2019s service, but a Cainite with only eternity ahead of him? That Cainite must be very moved indeed to make such a change in his unlife. Respect, then, the Cainite who can change, for he has retained one of the best gifts of humanity\u2014the best of the past, as Acindynus says. And also respect the force that can change him, for that is true power.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> One from the Lasombra, Gotson: <br /> \u201cJ\u00fcrgen, there is no honor lost in fear. God gave man fear for good reasons\u2014we are to fear God as a boy fears his father, fear Satan for the monster he is, fear the beasts of the forest for their claws and fangs, and so on. Your feeling fear when looking upon me reflects your wisdom, and, perhaps, your piety.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> And here two lines from a very nice back and forth between Malachite and Dracon:<br /> -Malachite: \u201cThe Dream is not dead,\u201d Malachite answered, quietly. \u201cThe Dream has only changed its shape. It cannot die, even if all of its symbols crumble and fall to dust. The Dream is a thing with its own life. Do you give it so little credit, hidden one?\u201d <br /> -Drac\u00f3n: \u201cI give it all the credit it deserves,\u201d the Dracon whispered tiredly. \u201cThe Dream will survive all who first saw it blossom, and helped give it its first form. My time as its custodian is at an end. The last task I set myself is done. Michael is avenged. Those who sought to diminish and sully what he created are dead or undone. Narses is destroyed, and the Heresy destroyed with him.\u201d He bowed his head again, a curtain of dark hair falling across his face. \u201cAnd I am so tired.<br /> <br /> <br /> And one last from Drac\u00f3n, which is pretty much Elderdom in one line:<br /> \u201cYou cannot imagine it, childe of my blood, and I hope you never have cause to. I hope that you do not see the night when you have outlasted everything and everyone that you have ever loved, and watched everything that you tried to preserve crumble around you.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Strange... When coincidence seems too convenient, I prefer to call it fate.</i><br /> <br /> <b><sup>-Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain</sup> </b>d=","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25534-banu_saulot","name":"Banu_Saulot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25534_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-04T22:48:28-07:00","id":1485819,"title":"","content":"Not that oroginal, bad still, badass<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't bother running, you'll only die tired&quot;<br /> - Nightshade, Kiasyd Assassin<br /> <br /> But my two favorites are of the Old Clan Tzimisce quotes, from a PG:<br /> <br /> &quot;Thousands of human lives have been taken by my hands. I am a protector of humanity, but my vigilance comes with a price&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Old ways do not die. Like old Cainites, they merely sleep, awaiting sufficient blood to reawaken them...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-04T23:38:47-07:00","id":1485820,"title":"","content":"From a Sabbat game I played in years ago. Players were an Appearance 5 Toreador Antitribu who had the habit of kidnapping people more beautiful than him and mutilating them, a Nosferatu and Brujah.<br /> <br /> Toreador (to the Nosferatu): &quot;I know that you and others of your kind are burdened by your appearance. But I want you to know that I understand. While my body may look normal my soul is twisted and hideous like a burnt and blackened rose. The truth is, I am just as disfigured on the inside as you are on the outside.&quot;<br /> <br /> Brujah: &quot;Wow. Wow, did you <i>really</i> just compare <i>your</i> soul to Mike's face? Like, I know Mike's kinda hard to look at but damn, that's low. And Mike, if you want to go monomancy and tear his throat out for that I get you. There are some insults that are just <i>not</i> okay.&quot;<br /> <br /> That phrase &quot;There are some insults that are just <i>not</i> okay,&quot; outlived the campaign and we, the players, were quoting it for years whenever someone would say something that could come off as a tiny bit insulting to someone. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-06T02:05:28-07:00","id":1485894,"title":"","content":"Malkavian to and about himself:<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm Nicolai, who doesn't hear voices in his head anymore&quot;<br /> *Yes you do*<br /> &quot;No, I don't&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26274,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26274-moriaki","user":"Moriaki","date":". 07-06-2022, 05:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26274-moriaki","name":"Moriaki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26274_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-06T02:31:01-07:00","id":1485895,"title":"","content":"Oh I could do this all day. I have so many in game quotes I've seen or said over the years.<br /> <br /> Snark<br /> <br /> Brujah-&quot;right what do both anarchs and elders fear?&quot;<br /> Nosferatu-&quot; getting a real job?&quot;<br /> <br /> Same brujah-&quot; ah here comes the prince....I feel safer already.&quot;<br /> <br /> Toreador harpy-&quot;well the ventrue are the naturally rulers of kindred on the grounds the other candidates are the lasombra and the brujah.&quot;<br /> <br /> Prince-&quot;I havnt been this disappointed since I first met a malkavian.&quot;<br /> <br /> Lasombra to her ghoul-&quot; if I wanted your opinion I'd tell you it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Romantic<br /> <br /> Same lasombra-&quot;Well you've presented me with a dillema Mike.&quot;<br /> Serpant of the light Mike recovering from 5 levels of agg-&quot;?&quot;<br /> Lasombra-&quot;I assumed this would be a casual fling because I thought you're a little bitch but you just survived combat with a eldar gangrel this means you might be around for a while. At the same time I'm beginning to find your annoying face entering my train of thought.....i find myself wondering about how you're doing and when you brought me flowers I actually felt like who I was rather what they did to me...it felt nice, its been 4 years since anything felt nice.&quot;<br /> Mike-&quot;okay so....?&quot;<br /> Lasombra-&quot;I want to you to ask me out on a date, I'm not talking blood orgy or the weird evil shit we do on a nightly basis. I'm talking an actual date, movie, stupid jokes making out. I want to feel like a person and I know you want me in a very human way. I think this could really work.&quot;<br /> Mike-&quot;right.....wait you were only going out with me because you didn't expect me to last long?&quot;<br /> Lasombra-&quot;oh sweety don't be horrid. You made the first moves because I have a great ass and didn't know anything about lasombra nobody in their right mind would ever date a keeper otherwise.&quot;<br /> <br /> Inspirational<br /> <br /> On the tzmisce antiduluvian-&quot;listen its not a god, it's just some sick fuck who somebody made the mistake of embracing who then made a load more sick fucks. The fact it thinks it's a god is a big advantage because it still catches fire and doesn't like the sun.&quot;<br /> <br /> -later on <br /> <br /> &quot;I wish he (tzmisce) was as good a person as i try to be every day.&quot;-a boon asked of archangel Michael (the actual one)<br /> <br /> Tzmisce Bishop to a terrified mother and daughter-&quot;do not grieve soon you will be so much more than you are now...&quot;<br /> salubri antitribu templar-&quot;NO MORE!&quot;<br /> Bishop-&quot;wha?&quot;<br /> -Vengeance of Samuel activated-<br /> Salubri Antitribu&quot;I HAD ENOUGH OF YOUR STUPID EVIL BULLSHIT!&quot;<br /> -Decapitates Bishop-<br /> Warrior Salubri-&quot;no more.....no more damn you.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Horror-<br /> : phone rings:<br /> Brujah pc -&quot;WHERES MY DAUGHTER?&quot;<br /> Sabbat templar-&quot;Well I'll tell you were she's not...safe.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Bonus mage the ascension quotes.<br /> <br /> Order of Hermes-&quot;Well she's a vampire or a huge bitch.&quot;<br /> -later-<br /> Order of hermes-&quot;nate you gotta get outta there she's a vampire AND a huge bitch.&quot;<br /> <br /> Same ooh-&quot;why yes child, I'm with dimberlydoo, now please get in the van.&quot;<br /> <br /> Celestial chorus trying to do a combined ritual with a sons of ether-&quot;er lord? Oh bless this raygun?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 07-06-2022, 07:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-08T11:49:52-07:00","id":1486056,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1351502-quotes?p=1351640#post1351640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I remember that! I sure hope Montano isn't right</div> </div> </div> </div>Sadly he probably is and I think the Assamite Sorceror Ur-Shurgi voiced a similar quote in there clan book.<br /> <br /> The gist was &quot;that there is no freedom. Just a lack of awareness of ones masters.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-08T14:04:44-07:00","id":1486066,"title":"","content":"'I remember that! I sure hope Montano isn't right' <br /> <br /> well with dominate powers like far mastery and speak through the blood montano is <span style=\"color:#202124\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">almost certainly on to something when he say that but it is kinda funny and horrifying to know that even a lot of the elders in the world of darkness are much like their young in the sense that they are nothing more then pawns to </span></span></span>ancient monsters who hide in far and forgotten places.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27369-the-smiling-gun-knight","name":"The smiling gun-knight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-09T09:19:31-07:00","id":1486101,"title":"","content":"Here is a few quotes from npcs that stood out for me.<br /> <br /> Postas: Elderly Obrimos Mage of great power. &quot;Do you think yourself wise, young one? Important? Powerful? You are none of these things. You are a whelp with delusions of Grandeur. Allow me to illustrate to you your insufficencies.&quot;<br /> <br /> Culsu: Moros Mage. &quot;Most speak, a very few listen, and the barest fraction understands.&quot;<br /> <br /> Now from Vampire The Masquerade.<br /> <br /> My character quotes<br /> <br /> &quot;Werewolves, elders and ancients with their vast powers don't scare me the same way as people who willingly choose this state.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We can not afford to relax our vigil for a moment. We have way to many enemies ready to pounce.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 07-14-2022, 01:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-14T10:37:09-07:00","id":1486444,"title":"","content":"Other quotes from my Brujah character <br /> <br /> &quot; I only get scared of the Nosferatu is when they are all gone from there hangouts. Then you know something bad is going to happen.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;My Great Grandsire has became a serious gamer and has a Youtube channel now. All I can say is wow.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-14T11:14:05-07:00","id":1486449,"title":"","content":"Serpent of the Light:<br /> - Isn't your honor a twisted thing? - asks Chidy with a grin - you will help with getting them harmed, but once the job is already done you won't reap the benefits. Isn't that a bit hypocritical? -<br /> <br /> Nosferatu:<br /> As you can see, everything about me is twisted.<br /> - call it what you want, I\u2019m aware of the thin line I\u2019m threading","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27429-microcuchon","name":"Microcuchon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-16T09:11:37-07:00","id":1486628,"title":"","content":"My pragmatic Brujah idealist keeping it real.<br /> <br /> &quot;Your shocked that a clan of passionite rebels, free-thinkers, scholars and warrior-poets would be very disorganized? We are not the Ventrue folks.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T12:52:25-07:00","id":1487235,"title":"","content":"&quot;Anything with a pulse?&quot;<br /> &quot;Picky, picky&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't overdo the whole &quot;elders can't cope with technology&quot; thing. The old stories of witches talking through magic mirrors and enchanted pools are true. I was doing international video conferencing in the eleventh century. Facetime on an iPhone holds no terrors for me. Four hundred years from now, some punk neonate will probably assume that you can't handle the idea of a starship because they didn't exist when you were born. And I hope I'm there to see the sulky expression on your face&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/100-jezmiller","name":"JezMiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"437"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-25T13:49:33-07:00","id":1487934,"title":"","content":"&quot;No I don't know Gary from Ottawa. I'm sure he is a nice guy for a Ventrue&quot; A moment of levity when kindred learn that my Brujah is from South Western Canada.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}